From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP regionizer cut: packed-spawn hole that holds

Native cut flag in ThreadedRegionizer (skip empty-section create, BFS will not
jump the band). PLAYER/sim tickets cannot refill the corridor. Thin 1-section
gap + grid-exponent 3 so a VD=10 spawn blob has enough sections to cut.
Post-applyAllPatches.
